SUMMARY:Intermediate Stained Glass: Experience Required
DESCRIPTION:This four hour class builds on the basics of the copper foil\, or “Tiffany\,” method of creating stained glass. This process includes cutting\, grinding\, foiling\, and soldering individual glass pieces. Students will also learn to work with tinned copper wire to create fine details and flourishes. All materials are included in class pricing.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/intermediate-stained-glass-experience-required/
LOCATION:Fusion Gallery\, 321 W Main St\, Durham\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art
