SUMMARY:Partner Yoga: A Practice for Two
DESCRIPTION:NOTE: Your registration covers TWO people (yourself + your guest). Only one person of the pair needs to register. \nIn this workshop\, we invite you to discover and explore what it takes to practice yoga asana with another person. Whether you come with a significant other\, bestie\, yoga buddy\, or family member\, practicing partner yoga is always a lot of fun. We open the practice by being together\, breathing together\, and creating connection. Then we practice many familiar yoga poses in partnership – doing some poses together and giving each other hands-on adjustments and assists in others. This practice is a safe place to laugh\, build trust\, and be curious. Often participants say that it teaches us about communication not only with our own bodies but with those of other people. \nPlease join us after our studio session has concluded to enjoy a cup of tea! \nTo get a glimpse into what partner yoga looks like check out our video https://youtu.be/pQIOxHE0sW8.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/partner-yoga-a-practice-for-two/
LOCATION:Yoga Off East\, 324 Blackwell Street\, Suite 420\, Durham\, 27701
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Nov-Partner-Yoga.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Yoga Off East":MAILTO:hello@yogaoffeast.com
GEO:35.99385;-78.9052899
