SUMMARY:A Taste of Saved Messages
DESCRIPTION:A Taste of Saved Messages: A Chef’s Dinner\, Reception & Show \nJoin us for an unforgettable evening of food\, art and community! The night opens with a welcome reception\, followed by an elevated chef’s dinner by Chef Caleb of Taste of BLK. Then enjoy a first look at Saved Messages\, a funny\, heartfelt new play by Carlita Victoria about mental health\, resilience and the voices that carry us through.\nWhether you’re a foodie\, a theatre lover\, or looking for a meaningful night out with friends and family this holiday weekend\, there’s a seat for you. All are welcome!\nProceeds support Darkness RISING Project’s free therapy\, reentry support and wellness programs.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/a-taste-of-saved-messages/
LOCATION:NorthStar Church of the Arts\, NorthStar Church of the Arts\, 220 W. Geer St.\, Durham\, NC 27701\, Durham\, 27701
