SUMMARY:Holiday Record Fair at Motorco!
DESCRIPTION:Motorco Holiday Record Fair\nSunday Nov 29: Noon – 5pm \nDig through crates and discover your next favorite record at the Motorco Record Fair. Packed with vendors selling everything from rare LPs and 45s to classic gems and deep cuts across every genre\, it’s a vinyl lover’s paradise right in the heart of Durham. Whether you’re a seasoned collector or just starting your stack\, come hang\, sip a drink\, and lose yourself in the sound. FREE.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/holiday-record-fair-at-motorco/
LOCATION:Motorco\, 723 Rigsbee\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/holidaymarketNOV.png
