SUMMARY:Dashi's Winter Hideaway
DESCRIPTION:December 1–January 3\nEscape the cold at Dashi’s Winter Hideaway ❄️✨ We’ve transformed the izakaya into a warm\, cozy retreat filled with greenery\, glowing decor\, and plenty of ways to stay warm. \nThe limited-time menu features festive cocktails served in keepsake glass mugs to take home\, plus Japanese whisky and winter sake flights. Pair your drinks with cozy bites like miso buttered corn ribs\, crispy rice bites\, and short rib croquettes. \nCome upstairs\, get comfortable\, and disappear into the Hideaway for a while!\nDashi’s Winter Hideaway runs December 1–January 3.
