DESCRIPTION:Explore the craftsmanship and flavor of whiskey woven through Dashi’s December omakase 🥃✨ The night’s five courses will showcase the warm\, smoky character of whiskey as a featured ingredient\, from seafood to dessert\, with a vegetarian experience available as well. \nA global selection of whiskey\, bourbon\, and rye pairs with each dish for a deeper dive into winter’s favorite spirit. Enjoy the warmth of the season in a twinkling izakaya\, transformed into a cozy Winter Hideaway with lights and decor 🩵 \nReservations available at our Downtown Durham izakaya at www.dashiramen.com/omakase.\n$65 five course dinner + $35 optional beverage pairings or $25 non-alcoholic pairings
