SUMMARY:ATC Tower Lighting
DESCRIPTION:Mark your calendars for this annual community event to kick off the holiday season and light the Lucky Strike Tower in coordination with the WRAL Tower in Raleigh and Rocky Mount Mills Tower in Rocky Mount. This includes a live televised portion on WRAL with on-air personality Dan Haggerty (and special guests) that leads right into the tree lighting at Rockefeller Center on NBC. \nThe Tower Stage will be hopping\, with Jeanne Jolly & The Mistletoes kicking things off at 6pm\, and Durham’s own Fust playing us into the night at 7:15. \nWe’ll also have plenty of family-friendly activities all night long. It’s free and open to the public\, so spread the word!
