SUMMARY:Holiday Music Series: Bell Durham
DESCRIPTION:This holiday season\, we’re celebrating with a series of festive performances throughout the hotel. Join us in the Coffee Bar for a holiday performance by Bell Durham\, a community handbell ensemble based in Durham\, on Wednesday\, December 2\, 6–7 PM. Hot toddies and warm treats are available from the Coffee Bar. \nBell Durham is a 501(c)(3) non-profit organization dedicated to sharing the joy of handbell music and enriching the local arts community. They will ring in the holiday spirit with two enchanting 30-minute sets of seasonal music\, perfect for an evening of warmth and festivity. \nUpcoming Dates in our Holiday Music on the Roof Series: \nTuesday\, December 15: United Strings of Color\nWednesday\, December 16: Triangle Gay Men’s Chorus
